WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.425
The air was getting colder.

2
00:00:11.426 --> 00:00:19.555
The days were getting shorter.

3
00:00:19.556 --> 00:00:25.057
Kip was counting his acorns.

4
00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:30.347
"This should be enough," Kip said.

5
00:00:30.348 --> 00:00:33.108
He looked down at Bird.

6
00:00:33.109 --> 00:00:37.225
"I'm really looking forward to winter."

7
00:00:37.226 --> 00:00:39.843
"I'm glad," said Bird.

8
00:00:39.844 --> 00:00:42.896
"You will have lots of fun this winter."

9
00:00:42.897 --> 00:00:45.864
"No," said Kip.

10
00:00:45.865 --> 00:00:49.916
" We will have lots of fun this

11
00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:55.031
winter." "Actually," said Bird. "I wanted to tell

12
00:00:55.032 --> 00:00:58.198
you—" "That you love sledding?" asked Kip.

13
00:00:58.199 --> 00:01:02.023
"No, not that," said Bird.

14
00:01:02.024 --> 00:01:06.389
"That you love ice-skating?" asked Kip.

15
00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:09.814
"Not that either," said Bird.

16
00:01:09.815 --> 00:01:13.018
"Well, what then?" asked Kip.

17
00:01:13.019 --> 00:01:18.160
"I'm flying south for the winter," said Bird.

18
00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:22.632
"You're flying south for the winter?" asked Kip.

19
00:01:22.633 --> 00:01:27.190
"Yes," said Bird. "But don't worry.

20
00:01:27.191 --> 00:01:33.983
I'll be back in the spring."

21
00:01:33.984 --> 00:01:37.782
"Why are you going?" asked Kip.

22
00:01:37.783 --> 00:01:45.536
"Because," said Bird. "It's what birds do."

